 - In these scripts the per-component covariance $L_kL_k^\top+\sigma^2 I$ is initialised by randomized SVD and refined by a few hundred Adam steps on the responsibility-weighted Gaussian likelihood (`learn_lowrank_cov_fast`). The `ccvfm` package uses the closed-form PPCA estimator, which is the same model without the refinement.[m
